WEBVTT

00:00:02.055 --> 00:00:05.855
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.293 --> 00:00:10.127
Todoke Message

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:19.461
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:20.740
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:28.782
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.782 --> 00:00:29.111
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.316 --> 00:00:36.518
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:41.020
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.127 --> 00:00:45.120
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.432 --> 00:00:49.528
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.703 --> 00:00:53.104
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.433
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.744 --> 00:01:01.578
Todoke Message

00:01:01.982 --> 00:01:10.082
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.523 --> 00:01:14.459
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.861 --> 00:01:18.661
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.132 --> 00:01:28.564
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:32.145 --> 00:01:34.136
On this day, early in spring...

00:01:34.214 --> 00:01:36.307
...Shurei, having passed
the Royal Examinations...

00:01:36.383 --> 00:01:38.351
...is on her way to
the Initiation Ceremony...

00:01:38.418 --> 00:01:40.113
...for those eligible
to be Court Officials.

00:01:40.186 --> 00:01:44.486
This is her first step as Saiunkoku's
first-ever female official.

00:01:44.991 --> 00:01:46.959
What a fine day it is today.

00:01:47.027 --> 00:01:50.190
Father, Seiran,
I'll be on my way now.

00:01:50.997 --> 00:01:52.726
Do your best, won't you?

00:01:52.966 --> 00:01:53.933
Yes!

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:59.227
Three Years on a Rock

00:02:04.477 --> 00:02:06.445
Are you ready?

00:02:07.247 --> 00:02:08.236
Yeah.

00:02:08.648 --> 00:02:10.172
Is everyone assembled?

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.115
Yes, more or less.

00:02:12.185 --> 00:02:15.018
Well, there is one person
who hasn't shown up.

00:02:20.927 --> 00:02:22.326
What a beautiful day it is.

00:02:22.796 --> 00:02:23.854
Yes.

00:02:25.999 --> 00:02:28.467
Oh, what a lovely day it is, Koyu.

00:02:29.269 --> 00:02:32.170
On the day you passed the exam,
in first place at the age of sixteen...

00:02:32.238 --> 00:02:34.206
...you were running away
from high ranking officials...

00:02:34.274 --> 00:02:36.208
...who were asking you
to become their son-in-law.

00:02:36.276 --> 00:02:38.767
Today's sky has the exact same color
as it did that day.

00:02:44.551 --> 00:02:45.916
What is it, Koyu?

00:02:45.985 --> 00:02:49.978
Well, Reishin. I was wondering if you
still intend to keep the fact that...

00:02:50.357 --> 00:02:52.985
...you're serving as Shurei's sponsor
a secret from her.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.926
I have to tell her
I'm her uncle first.

00:02:56.563 --> 00:02:58.793
In that case, it probably won't be
for quite a while, will it?

00:02:58.865 --> 00:03:01.333
The best should always be
saved for last.

00:03:05.338 --> 00:03:08.068
Reishin Hong, Senior Secretary of
the Ministry of Civil Affairs...

00:03:08.141 --> 00:03:10.769
...and Koyu Ri, Assistant Secretary
of the Ministry of Civil Affairs...

00:03:11.478 --> 00:03:13.343
...have just arrived!

00:03:17.984 --> 00:03:20.009
There's more of a commotion today...

00:03:20.086 --> 00:03:22.418
...than when Koyu Ri
and Shuei Ran passed the exams.

00:03:22.489 --> 00:03:26.289
That should be expected,
with the top three being who they are.

00:03:29.028 --> 00:03:30.859
Eigetsu To.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:33.592
Passing the exams and taking
first place at the age of thirteen...

00:03:33.666 --> 00:03:36.362
...smashing Koyu's previous
record with ease.

00:03:36.736 --> 00:03:40.502
Second place went to Shuei Ran's
younger brother, Ryuren, right?

00:03:41.007 --> 00:03:43.635
But skipping the initiation ceremony
is simply unheard of!

00:03:43.843 --> 00:03:46.004
This year certainly is an odd year.

00:03:46.079 --> 00:03:48.411
As soon as the National Examination
system was opened to women...

00:03:48.481 --> 00:03:50.608
...one came in
and took third place!

00:03:50.683 --> 00:03:52.412
You know, that girl looks
an awful lot like the princess...

00:03:52.485 --> 00:03:55.886
...who entered the Royal Harem
a short while ago.
- She does, now that you mention it!

00:03:55.955 --> 00:03:57.684
I think she looks more
like that boy...

00:03:57.757 --> 00:04:00.419
...who was working for the
Department of Finance last summer.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.928
Maybe they're siblings.

00:04:02.996 --> 00:04:05.191
Things are gonna get
pretty hectic around here.

00:04:05.265 --> 00:04:06.857
I'm sure she's prepared for it.

00:04:06.933 --> 00:04:08.332
All we can do...

00:04:08.735 --> 00:04:13.195
...is wait for her to claw her way to
where we sit. Don't you agree, Reishin?

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.608
Yes, you're right about that.

00:04:16.109 --> 00:04:20.478
The King of Saiunkoku,
Ryuki Shi has arrived!

00:04:24.517 --> 00:04:26.883
- Things are finally getting underway.
- Yeah.

00:04:26.953 --> 00:04:29.046
Why don't we sit back
and observe...

00:04:29.122 --> 00:04:31.750
...as the youngsters work together
to create a new era.

00:04:32.459 --> 00:04:36.691
This year, passing in first place,
Jogen, Eigetsu To!

00:04:37.497 --> 00:04:38.555
Yes!

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:43.135
Second place,
Bogen, Ryuren Ran!

00:04:48.808 --> 00:04:51.038
Third place,
Tanka, Shurei Hong.

00:04:51.778 --> 00:04:52.745
Yes!

00:05:00.487 --> 00:05:02.512
These top three
are hereby acknowledged...

00:05:02.589 --> 00:05:03.715
...for their outstanding
achievements.

00:05:09.829 --> 00:05:11.421
Kogaro

00:05:16.436 --> 00:05:17.903
Miss Kocho!

00:05:19.072 --> 00:05:21.563
The Initiation Ceremony was held today
as planned, and...!

00:05:23.576 --> 00:05:25.544
I'm sorry to have to say this, Shurei.

00:05:25.845 --> 00:05:28.370
I think it would be best if you
stopped coming here for a while.

00:05:35.755 --> 00:05:37.882
Oh, right. We're outta salt.

00:05:39.325 --> 00:05:41.293
May I have a bag of salt, please?

00:05:41.361 --> 00:05:42.419
Yes!

00:05:48.034 --> 00:05:52.095
I'd better hurry on home. Koyu and
General Ran will be arriving soon.

00:05:54.574 --> 00:05:57.042
Hello! Is your back feeling any better?

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:58.543
Yes, thank you.

00:06:08.721 --> 00:06:10.120
Excuse me.

00:06:10.189 --> 00:06:12.919
This is absurd! You lost the ring?!

00:06:12.992 --> 00:06:15.358
That ring signifies leadership
of the Sa family!

00:06:15.428 --> 00:06:18.420
We just found it,
so how could you let this happen?!

00:06:19.032 --> 00:06:21.500
I've already reported that
it has been found!

00:06:21.701 --> 00:06:23.669
If they find out I don't have it...

00:06:23.736 --> 00:06:26.000
...the reward money and
chance of promotion will be lost!

00:06:26.072 --> 00:06:28.734
Kocho, sorry but
I won't be staying tonight!

00:06:29.142 --> 00:06:31.110
That really is too bad.

00:06:38.585 --> 00:06:40.985
Did you get lost on your way
here again?

00:06:41.054 --> 00:06:42.180
Shut up.

00:06:42.655 --> 00:06:47.092
That aside, I heard you've been going
to that whorehouse again lately.

00:06:47.727 --> 00:06:51.754
Don't be jealous. I'm just a normal,
healthy adult man, after all.

00:06:51.831 --> 00:06:53.492
What you need,
instead of a whorehouse...

00:06:53.566 --> 00:06:55.727
...is a doctor who will replace
that rotten head of yours!

00:06:55.802 --> 00:06:58.737
Come on,
I'm doing my work sufficiently.

00:06:58.805 --> 00:07:01.774
I received a report that
the ring was found.

00:07:01.841 --> 00:07:02.933
What?

00:07:03.009 --> 00:07:05.500
But apparently it was lost again.

00:07:05.912 --> 00:07:08.574
What's that supposed to mean?
Is it some kind of joke?

00:07:10.049 --> 00:07:13.849
Well now, why don't we head on over
to enjoy Shurei's home cooking.

00:07:14.387 --> 00:07:15.786
Today, we're going to celebrate.

00:07:19.626 --> 00:07:21.890
It's not like I've changed at all.

00:07:25.398 --> 00:07:26.558
Miss Shurei!

00:07:26.633 --> 00:07:27.861
Eigetsu?!

00:07:29.569 --> 00:07:31.469
Don't tell me you got
into another fight.

00:07:31.904 --> 00:07:34.566
Well, it sure does look that way.

00:07:35.842 --> 00:07:37.400
What a relief.

00:07:37.477 --> 00:07:39.968
At least I didn't run
into your other personality.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.074
Lady Shurei!
I've been looking for you.

00:07:43.216 --> 00:07:45.207
- Seiran.
- Mr. Seiran.

00:07:45.284 --> 00:07:48.310
Oh, so you were with Eigetsu.

00:07:48.388 --> 00:07:49.252
Yes.

00:07:49.322 --> 00:07:50.414
My Lady.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:54.051
I made it clear to you that you
shouldn't be going out on your own.

00:07:54.994 --> 00:07:57.656
The initiates have just
received their salaries...

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:00.096
...which make you targets for thugs.

00:08:02.035 --> 00:08:05.095
Eigetsu, don't tell me
you've already been targeted.

00:08:05.338 --> 00:08:10.674
No, I haven't! I sent all eighty silver
coins to my hometown right away!

00:08:11.044 --> 00:08:13.137
All of it?

00:08:13.212 --> 00:08:14.008
Yes.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.275
Then why did you get into a fight?

00:08:16.883 --> 00:08:20.410
From what I can remember,
I was at some noble's estate...

00:08:20.753 --> 00:08:22.744
...and some guy forced me
to drink wine.

00:08:22.822 --> 00:08:25.313
Then he asked me if I'd like to
marry his daughter.

00:08:25.491 --> 00:08:27.584
You got into a fight
at a noble's house?!

00:08:27.927 --> 00:08:31.658
No. I made a run for it right after
he forced me to drink that wine...

00:08:31.731 --> 00:08:33.596
...so I highly doubt it.

00:08:33.666 --> 00:08:35.531
It'd probably be
in your best interest...

00:08:35.601 --> 00:08:38.195
...to turn down all banquet invitations
from now on.

00:08:38.304 --> 00:08:41.296
You did pass the exams
with the Jogen title, after all.

00:08:41.908 --> 00:08:45.036
Those who place in the top tier
enjoy various privileges.

00:08:45.278 --> 00:08:47.746
So naturally, you will be approached
by many people...

00:08:47.814 --> 00:08:50.578
...who want to become a relative of
an official with a promising future.

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:54.211
Yeah, good point.
That makes a lot of sense.

00:08:54.454 --> 00:08:55.853
By the way, Eigetsu...

00:08:55.922 --> 00:08:57.685
...I hope you sent a letter to tell
the people of your hometown...

00:08:57.757 --> 00:08:59.691
...you passed the exam.
- No.

00:08:59.759 --> 00:09:00.919
The Department of Protocol said...

00:09:00.993 --> 00:09:03.553
...they would send a messenger
by horse to notify my hometown...

00:09:03.629 --> 00:09:06.223
...so I just gave the money
to the messenger to deliver.

00:09:06.799 --> 00:09:08.562
Later, I'll give you some paper...

00:09:08.634 --> 00:09:10.727
...and I want you to write
a letter by the end of the day.

00:09:10.803 --> 00:09:12.771
- But...!
- No buts!

00:09:13.005 --> 00:09:16.099
You have to tell everyone back
home that you passed the exam.

00:09:16.642 --> 00:09:19.611
Eigetsu, I'm sure the people who are
waiting for word about your results...

00:09:20.079 --> 00:09:22.639
...will be a lot more pleased
to hear from you directly.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:25.644
Miss Shurei.

00:09:25.718 --> 00:09:29.552
Besides, you must write it to ensure
the safety of that money as well!

00:09:29.622 --> 00:09:32.716
What? To ensure the safety
of the money?

00:09:32.792 --> 00:09:36.728
That's right! Sending all eighty
silver coins at once?!

00:09:37.096 --> 00:09:39.360
Even going through
the Department of Protocol...

00:09:39.432 --> 00:09:41.195
...in the hands
of the wrong messenger...

00:09:41.267 --> 00:09:43.633
...it's possible that only half of that
money will make it to its destination.

00:09:43.703 --> 00:09:48.072
The money should've been sent in
small amounts not worth stealing!

00:09:48.975 --> 00:09:52.069
Ah, is that so?!
You are amazing, Miss Shurei.

00:09:52.145 --> 00:09:53.737
You sure know how to deal
with money issues.

00:09:53.813 --> 00:09:58.113
When it comes to money, no one
is more clever than Lady Shurei.

00:09:58.284 --> 00:10:00.115
Stop it, you two!

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:05.682
By the way...

00:10:05.758 --> 00:10:09.660
...when will Shurei's group receive
notice of their placements, Koyu?

00:10:10.163 --> 00:10:14.190
Oh, you should be receiving
a written notice at some point soon.

00:10:14.433 --> 00:10:16.367
Oh, naturally.

00:10:16.736 --> 00:10:17.837
As it turned out...

00:10:17.837 --> 00:10:19.862
...this year's National Examinations
were fairly controversial.

00:10:19.939 --> 00:10:23.033
For instance, your younger brother
skipped the Initiation Ceremony.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:27.143
Well, that one is beyond
even my comprehension.

00:10:27.513 --> 00:10:29.276
I did expect him to run away...

00:10:29.348 --> 00:10:31.543
...but I didn't expect
it would happen so quickly.

00:10:31.617 --> 00:10:34.142
Like older brother,
like younger brother.

00:10:34.453 --> 00:10:37.149
Good lord! Neither of them can
take anything seriously.

00:10:37.456 --> 00:10:42.792
Um... he's quite an amazing person
in many ways, both inside and out.

00:10:45.331 --> 00:10:47.731
It's true! To be blunt,
if he had gotten first place...

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.995
...I would've lost hope
with the world...

00:10:50.069 --> 00:10:52.128
...for how cruel and unjust it can be!

00:10:52.705 --> 00:10:54.570
While everybody else was studying
so desperately...

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:56.301
...he was always
sleeping in the dorm!

00:10:56.375 --> 00:10:58.036
On the odd occasions
when he was awake...

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:00.044
...he was tooting away
on that flute of his!

00:11:00.112 --> 00:11:02.171
And to top it off, after stuffing
himself with a meal I prepared...

00:11:02.248 --> 00:11:03.340
...he seriously said...

00:11:03.416 --> 00:11:08.683
..."If you miss out on finding a husband,
I'll hire you as my personal chef."

00:11:08.754 --> 00:11:12.656
I seriously wanted
to kick his brains out!

00:11:13.759 --> 00:11:17.126
I restrained myself only because he's
General Ran's younger brother, but...!

00:11:17.997 --> 00:11:19.794
Thank you for restraining yourself.

00:11:21.033 --> 00:11:23.092
Sorry. I didn't mean to...!

00:11:23.536 --> 00:11:27.165
It's all right, Shurei.
You were telling the truth.

00:11:27.473 --> 00:11:29.407
Anyway, I bet you two
are looking forward...

00:11:29.475 --> 00:11:30.942
...to starting your
new jobs tomorrow.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.170
Yes.

00:11:32.245 --> 00:11:33.974
Let's do our best, Eigetsu.

00:11:34.046 --> 00:11:35.343
Yes, let's.

00:11:40.419 --> 00:11:43.047
I'm really looking forward to
finding out where we'll be assigned.

00:11:43.456 --> 00:11:45.754
Me too.
I wonder where we'll be.

00:11:46.225 --> 00:11:50.252
But I hope I'm not assigned
anywhere near the central palace.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:57.433
What should I do?
Secretary Kou will find out.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:00.161
But then again
he probably already knows.

00:12:00.239 --> 00:12:02.400
Shurei. Hang in there, okay?

00:12:02.942 --> 00:12:05.240
Whatever happens,
I'll be right there by your side.

00:12:05.778 --> 00:12:07.769
Thank you, Eigetsu.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:19.748
S-Secretary Kou!

00:12:30.836 --> 00:12:33.964
Um... Secretary Kou.
Last summer...!

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:35.371
What are you talking about?

00:12:36.309 --> 00:12:38.402
I used the name Shu Hong...!

00:12:38.811 --> 00:12:42.907
The Shu Hong I know is
a fairly capable young man.

00:12:43.449 --> 00:12:45.417
You would do well
to learn from him.

00:12:46.986 --> 00:12:47.850
Yes!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:52.721
By the way, should you two be
casually idling out here right now?

00:12:54.026 --> 00:12:57.120
What are you two doing over here?!
You're going to be late!

00:12:57.196 --> 00:12:58.424
L-Late?!

00:13:01.133 --> 00:13:03.829
The time stated
in the letter was wrong?!

00:13:03.903 --> 00:13:05.564
You've got to be kidding me!

00:13:05.638 --> 00:13:07.606
I can't afford to be late
on the first day!

00:13:07.673 --> 00:13:10.574
I can only imagine it's a prank
pulled by someone jealous of you!

00:13:10.643 --> 00:13:12.611
We sure seem to be hated!

00:13:12.778 --> 00:13:14.746
It'll be faster to cut through there!

00:13:16.148 --> 00:13:18.013
Up to this point, I had
high hopes for my future...

00:13:18.084 --> 00:13:19.847
...but now it's looking more like
a future of problems!

00:13:19.919 --> 00:13:21.147
That's why I'm here!

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.484
For the time being,
most of my duties as king...

00:13:23.556 --> 00:13:26.024
...have been handed over
to a more than capable individual!

00:13:28.794 --> 00:13:31.991
We... well, I will be your
personal guard starting today.

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:38.801
Somehow...!

00:13:38.871 --> 00:13:41.362
It looks like we made it in time.

00:13:42.641 --> 00:13:43.801
You two.

00:13:43.876 --> 00:13:46.606
Although it's a little late,
congratulations on passing the exams.

00:13:48.781 --> 00:13:50.373
They've wilted.

00:13:50.449 --> 00:13:54.476
I put them in my pocket after I picked
them, so... Pretend that didn't happen.

00:13:55.955 --> 00:13:58.446
Adonis amurensis,
congratulatory flowers. Thank you.

00:13:58.524 --> 00:14:00.151
These are more than enough.

00:14:00.226 --> 00:14:02.194
Well, we should be going.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:13.060
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:14:18.377 --> 00:14:21.073
- They actually came.
- They don't know what's good for them.

00:14:21.547 --> 00:14:23.310
A woman taking the Royal Exams.

00:14:23.382 --> 00:14:25.680
I bet they thought they'd lose face
if no woman passed...

00:14:25.751 --> 00:14:28.049
...so cut her some slack
and let her slip through.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:30.213
I was so thrilled to pass the exam...

00:14:30.289 --> 00:14:33.122
...but learning that a woman also passed,
I'm no longer so thrilled.

00:14:33.325 --> 00:14:37.056
Taking the Jogen title at thirteen?
What trick did he use to manage that?

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:40.490
We've got a woman and a kid.
This year is a joke.

00:14:45.271 --> 00:14:46.568
Senior Secretary Sai...

00:14:46.639 --> 00:14:49.039
...and Official Ro of the Department
of Protocol have arrived!

00:14:50.676 --> 00:14:54.544
First and foremost, I congratulate you all
on passing the National Examinations.

00:14:54.613 --> 00:14:56.376
This year, further to orders
from the king...

00:14:56.449 --> 00:14:59.077
...you, the top twenty examinees
will temporarily serve...

00:14:59.151 --> 00:15:01.312
...within the Royal Court.

00:15:01.387 --> 00:15:03.321
Although this will only be
for a short time...

00:15:03.389 --> 00:15:05.687
...I hope you will all make the most
of this opportunity...

00:15:05.758 --> 00:15:07.749
...and try to learn as much
as you can.

00:15:07.827 --> 00:15:10.660
In two months, your formal
placements will be decided...

00:15:10.729 --> 00:15:13.289
...based on your individual abilities.

00:15:13.365 --> 00:15:18.735
Until then, Official Ro of the Department
of Protocol will be your instructor.

00:15:18.938 --> 00:15:21.668
I'm sure he'll provide you
with the guidance you need.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:28.979
Official Ro, they have yet to be
appointed an official title and rank.

00:15:29.048 --> 00:15:30.845
Try not to be too harsh
on them.

00:15:30.916 --> 00:15:32.508
I know as much.

00:15:36.689 --> 00:15:39.658
You have managed
to place in the top twenty, and...

00:15:39.725 --> 00:15:41.784
...are the first new officials
of this king's reign.

00:15:41.861 --> 00:15:43.726
As such, you are
in a good position...

00:15:43.796 --> 00:15:46.094
...to be considered for important
governmental roles in the future.

00:15:46.165 --> 00:15:49.862
Over the next two months, you will be
assigned various practical jobs.

00:15:50.136 --> 00:15:52.161
While working your assignments...

00:15:52.238 --> 00:15:54.536
...after one and a half months
have passed...

00:15:54.607 --> 00:15:56.598
...you are to gather your
thoughts and submit a report.

00:15:56.675 --> 00:15:59.337
You do not necessarily have to
submit this report to me.

00:15:59.411 --> 00:16:01.436
You may submit it to
more than one person if you wish.

00:16:01.514 --> 00:16:03.573
The subject matter
and format is up to you.

00:16:04.049 --> 00:16:08.383
Recruit Hong, Recruit To,
your uniforms are filthy.

00:16:08.787 --> 00:16:10.152
U-Um, this...!

00:16:10.222 --> 00:16:13.817
Do not talk back!
Your appearance is a disgrace.

00:16:13.893 --> 00:16:16.555
Do you think this place
is some chicken coop?

00:16:17.196 --> 00:16:18.720
I'm sorry.

00:16:18.998 --> 00:16:21.728
It seems you're lacking self-awareness.
Very well.

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:24.064
I'll see to it later that you're
assigned to appropriate work.

00:16:25.404 --> 00:16:28.134
I will now issue your designated
assignment areas and duties.

00:16:28.207 --> 00:16:29.834
For further details of your duties...

00:16:29.909 --> 00:16:32.377
...please enquire within the departments
where you're assigned.

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:36.475
Toilet

00:16:36.549 --> 00:16:38.244
Bring it on!

00:16:38.317 --> 00:16:40.114
If they think something like this
is gonna discourage me...

00:16:40.186 --> 00:16:41.983
...they're in for a big surprise!

00:16:42.054 --> 00:16:44.716
I have experience in cleaning toilets
from previous jobs!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.690
But it really stinks,
just the same.

00:16:46.759 --> 00:16:49.922
Stuff that comes out of great officials
is no different from the rest of us.

00:16:53.232 --> 00:16:56.030
Well, at least now the toilets
look a little nicer.

00:16:56.635 --> 00:16:59.900
- Oh, it really stinks!
- It smells like there's a pig in here.

00:17:00.105 --> 00:17:03.074
That's disgusting.
Although this may be a toilet...

00:17:03.142 --> 00:17:06.373
...it's still unpleasant having one of those
roam around the holy Royal Court.

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:10.671
Speaking of which,
have you heard about it?

00:17:10.749 --> 00:17:12.410
Yes. It was quite a large amount
changing hands.

00:17:12.484 --> 00:17:16.215
- I wonder how it's being supplied.
- I'm not gonna let this get me down.

00:17:17.022 --> 00:17:21.516
Oh, I feel terrible having a Jogen like
you do stuff like polish my shoes.

00:17:22.228 --> 00:17:24.321
No need to.
This is my job, after all.

00:17:24.396 --> 00:17:27.126
But I guess with the meager lifestyle
of someone from way out...

00:17:27.199 --> 00:17:29.759
...in Koku Province, you'd
be used to this sort of work.

00:17:29.835 --> 00:17:31.666
Yes. You're absolutely right.

00:17:31.737 --> 00:17:35.104
Oh, but I've never polished
such fine shoes before.

00:17:35.741 --> 00:17:37.003
All right, I'm done!

00:17:37.076 --> 00:17:40.011
Oops! I lost my balance
for a second there.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.147
Oww.

00:17:44.516 --> 00:17:48.953
We're very busy, so I'll need you to
take care of both of us at the same time.

00:17:49.421 --> 00:17:51.480
Yes! With pleasure!

00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:57.124
By the way, Official Wa.
About that rumor.

00:17:57.196 --> 00:18:00.222
Yeah. I heard it was a ridiculous
amount of money.

00:18:11.277 --> 00:18:13.336
Oh, sorry. So sorry.

00:18:13.812 --> 00:18:15.404
Th-That's all right.

00:18:15.881 --> 00:18:18.179
I'll leave organizing
these documents to you.

00:18:27.026 --> 00:18:30.518
Shu is still cleaning the toilets?
Poor thing.

00:18:30.596 --> 00:18:32.461
It's been half a month already.

00:18:37.703 --> 00:18:41.537
And despite being a Jogen,
Recruit To is still polishing shoes.

00:18:42.441 --> 00:18:46.343
Their instructor is Official Ro.
It can't be helped.

00:18:46.412 --> 00:18:48.573
Those capable of clawing
their way up will do so.

00:18:48.647 --> 00:18:50.205
Don't concern yourself
over it.

00:18:50.683 --> 00:18:53.151
That aside, Yuri, take these.

00:18:53.585 --> 00:18:55.052
If I remember correctly...

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:57.179
...toilet cleaning and shoe polishing
duties are in the morning.

00:18:57.256 --> 00:18:59.884
In the afternoon I believe they organize
documents in the Archives.

00:19:00.292 --> 00:19:02.419
Add these in
with the other documents...

00:19:02.828 --> 00:19:05.228
...before Shurei and Recruit To
arrive at the Archives.

00:19:05.964 --> 00:19:08.558
How could you?
I am disappointed in you!

00:19:08.901 --> 00:19:11.096
People are already making things
more difficult for them...

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.730
...by giving them additional work
out of spite!

00:19:13.806 --> 00:19:15.239
So what?

00:19:16.141 --> 00:19:19.907
Think over your complaint
as you look through these documents.

00:19:23.048 --> 00:19:24.140
These are...!

00:19:24.316 --> 00:19:26.511
Go! I've heard enough
of your objections.

00:19:26.652 --> 00:19:27.676
Yes.

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:33.522
They say part of learning is
"three years on a rock".

00:19:33.892 --> 00:19:36.725
I just have to keep believing that
one day all of this will pay off.

00:19:40.199 --> 00:19:42.167
All right. I'm finished here.

00:19:43.235 --> 00:19:45.294
You're Hakumei Heki, right?

00:19:47.906 --> 00:19:50.136
What's wrong?
Do you have a stomach ache?

00:19:50.209 --> 00:19:53.178
No. Aren't you annoyed by all this?!

00:19:53.245 --> 00:19:56.373
You've been doing nothing but
clean toilets for half a month now!

00:19:56.548 --> 00:19:58.015
W-Well...!

00:19:58.584 --> 00:20:01.849
Well, maybe women really are
better suited to this kind of work.

00:20:03.489 --> 00:20:06.185
You're a woman!
Why did you take the National Exams?!

00:20:06.592 --> 00:20:08.059
W-Well, I...!

00:20:08.127 --> 00:20:11.460
I placed right behind you,
ranking fourth!

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:13.794
Me, the one hailed
a child prodigy!

00:20:14.133 --> 00:20:16.533
It's an embarrassment to have
placed below you...

00:20:16.602 --> 00:20:18.229
...the one in charge
of cleaning toilets!

00:20:23.075 --> 00:20:26.476
I have to work in the Archives next.
I should get going.

00:20:45.431 --> 00:20:47.524
It must be boring
cleaning the toilets.

00:20:47.599 --> 00:20:51.194
I will allow you to assist me
with my work.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.238
You ought to be grateful.

00:20:53.972 --> 00:20:56.440
Please have everything done
by tomorrow morning.

00:20:58.143 --> 00:21:00.111
Yes. I will have it done.

00:21:05.651 --> 00:21:08.415
You're a woman!
Why did you take the National Exams?!

00:21:11.323 --> 00:21:14.690
I should try and get some of this done
before Eigetsu gets here.

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:16.384
Shurei.

00:21:17.596 --> 00:21:18.858
Koyu.

00:21:18.997 --> 00:21:22.160
I'm looking for Shoka,
but it seems he's not here.

00:21:22.935 --> 00:21:24.994
Have you finished
cleaning the toilets?

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:26.196
Yes.

00:21:27.773 --> 00:21:29.673
Is this part of your work?

00:21:29.741 --> 00:21:31.106
No.

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:34.473
Yes it is! Eigetsu and I
agreed to take on this work!

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:36.847
I see.

00:21:45.691 --> 00:21:47.420
Fight your way up.

00:21:48.093 --> 00:21:50.425
From here on in,
you're on your own.

00:21:50.496 --> 00:21:52.726
Don't count on any help
from me or Shuei.

00:21:53.365 --> 00:21:56.732
But even so, claw your way up,
until you reach the place you want to be.

00:21:57.369 --> 00:21:59.337
Passing as Tanka at your age...

00:21:59.404 --> 00:22:01.463
...had nothing to do with my,
or Shoka's assistance.

00:22:01.740 --> 00:22:04.368
It happened because you had
a strong desire within your heart.

00:22:04.676 --> 00:22:08.043
If not for that, you could not have
become Tanka at the age of seventeen.

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:11.406
There is a place you want
to get to, right?!

00:22:15.387 --> 00:22:16.854
There is!

00:22:19.591 --> 00:22:22.890
From now on, that desire
is what's going to support you.

00:22:23.128 --> 00:22:26.291
Fight your way up to where you want
to be as if your life depended on it.

00:22:26.698 --> 00:22:27.756
I'll be waiting.

00:22:29.167 --> 00:22:31.863
Koyu, thank you so much.

00:22:34.406 --> 00:22:35.532
Koyu!

00:22:36.775 --> 00:22:37.764
What is it?

00:22:37.843 --> 00:22:40.107
It's almost time for lunch,
so I'm leaving.

00:22:40.279 --> 00:22:43.806
Well... the exit isn't over there.

00:22:45.350 --> 00:22:47.443
This mountain of books
is so disorienting!

00:22:47.653 --> 00:22:51.180
Why are there so many books here?!
Because it's the Archives?!

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:15.443
From now on, that desire
is what's going to support you.

00:23:15.781 --> 00:23:18.875
Fight your way up to where you want
to be as if your life depended on it.

00:23:19.885 --> 00:23:23.286
The one thing that will
support me is my desire.

00:23:30.629 --> 00:23:35.726
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.934 --> 00:23:42.271
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.574 --> 00:23:47.534
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.746 --> 00:23:52.843
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.852 --> 00:23:58.255
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.791 --> 00:24:04.922
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.697 --> 00:24:16.266
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.142 --> 00:24:22.739
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.148 --> 00:24:28.211
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.087 --> 00:24:34.650
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:35.027 --> 00:24:41.830
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.137 --> 00:24:45.937
Next Episode

00:24:45.937 --> 00:24:47.906
Next Episode
Whether it's toilet cleaning or shoe
polishing, I'll do whatever I have to!

00:24:47.906 --> 00:24:49.841
Next Episode
A Child Knows Not
of His Parent's Feelings
Whether it's toilet cleaning or shoe
